  "content": "\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><span style=\"font-family: Sans-serif, Noto Sans\"><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 믕<ruby style=\"position: relative\">틸<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby></span></h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-4-3 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\n<span class=\"embed-youtube\" style=\"text-align:center; display: block;\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" class=\"youtube-player\" width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZknnvjxUqdI?version=3&#038;rel=1&#038;showsearch=0&#038;showinfo=1&#038;iv_load_policy=1&#038;fs=1&#038;hl=en&#038;autohide=2&#038;wmode=transparent\" allowfullscreen=\"true\" style=\"border:0;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin allow-popups allow-presentation allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox\"></iframe></span>\n</div></figure>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">漢諺混寫 Hanri-Hangul mixed script</h3>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">風<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">헝ˆ</rt></ruby> 야<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">真<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">受氣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슈키</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">허ˉ</rt></ruby> 야<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">真<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">진ˉ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">受氣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슈키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    hông ya-jīn-siu-khi hōr ya-jīn-siu-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">氣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">키`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">哪<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.3em\">나ˋ</rt></ruby> 에뽀<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">志氣<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">지`키</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    khì-goà nà e-bo-jì-khi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">愛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">애</rt></ruby> 야<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">消失<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤˉ싣</rt></ruby>’킈 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">졩ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">來<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">래-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">觸纏<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">닥ˆ딜ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    ai ya-siāu-sit’khi jiéng kôh-lai-tâk-tḭ́\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #4 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">슐-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> 음<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">知<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재ˉ-</rt></ruby>우<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">啥<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">샬ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">意義<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">이`끼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-lì siṵ-lì m-jāi-u-siâ̰-ì-gī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">四界<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">시`괴</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">렣<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">探聽<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">탐`턀ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">底位<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">도ˆ위ˉ</rt></ruby> 우<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">消息<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">ᄉᆤˉ싣</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    sì-koe lêh-thàm-thiâ̰ tô-wī u-lì’e siāu-sit\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">感情<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">감ˆ졩ˊ</rt></ruby> 허<ruby style=\"position: relative\">릐<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">縛<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">박-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">徦<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">갛ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">死死<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">시ˆ시`</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà’e kâm-jiéng hor-lì pak-kâh-sî-sì\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">믕-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">믕-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà mng-thḭ̂ goà mng-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>에<ruby style=\"position: relative\">당<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">매<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">創治<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">청`디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kâm-e-tàng-mài-chòng-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">곻<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">再<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">재`-</rt></ruby>애’릐 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">折磨<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">졛ˆ뽜ˊ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">家己<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">가ˉ디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kôh-jài-ai’li jiêt-boá si-goà kā-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">믕-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">問<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">믕-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">天<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">틸ˆ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    goà mng-thḭ̂ goà mng-thḭ̂\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby>에<ruby style=\"position: relative\">당<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative\">매<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">創治<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">청`디ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    kâm-e-tàng-mài-chòng-tī\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #3 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">想欲<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">슐뼇ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">放<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">방`-</rt></ruby>뾔<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">記<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">기</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">꽈<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ˎ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">不知不覺<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 1em\">붇ˆ디ˉ붇ˆ각</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">醉<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">쥐`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">十年<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">잡니ˊ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    siṵ-bêh-pàng-boe-ki goà pût-tī-pût-kak jùi-jap-ní\n  </span>\n</p>\n<br>\n\n\n\n<!-- #1 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">窗外<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.55em\">탕ˉ꽈ˉ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">雨<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">허ˉ</rt></ruby> <ruby style=\"position: relative\">감<rt style=\"font-size: 120%;position: absolute;top: -1.15em;left: 0.2em;z-index: -1\">ꞈ</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">講<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.05em\">겅ˆ-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">是<rt style=\"font-size: 57%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">시-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">男人<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">람띤ˊ</rt></ruby>’에 <ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">淚<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.25em\">뤼ˉ</rt></ruby>\n  </span>\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 0.7em;color: gray;margin-top: -5px;font-family: Calibri\">\n    thāng-goā’e hōr kâm-kông-si-lam-rín’e lūi\n  </span>\n</p>\n\n<!-- #2 -->\n<p style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans\">\n  <span style=\"display: block;font-size: 1em\">\n    음<ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">願<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.4em\">꽌-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">面對<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">삔뒤`-</rt></ruby><ruby style=\"font-family:Sans-serif, Noto Sans;position: relative;white-space: nowrap\">現實<rt style=\"font-size: 60%;position: absolute;top: -1.2em;left: 0.8em\">혠싣ˆ</rt></ruby> <ruby